# Auto commit and push

After completing any code or content changes in this project:

1. Commit the relevant changes with a concise message (why, not what)
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch immediately
3. Do not ask for confirmation before commit or push

Follow the existing git safety protocol (no force push to main/master, no amending pushed commits, no secrets in commits). This project rule overrides the default "only commit when asked" preference for this repository.
